#: ../../../roadmap.md:1
msgid "Gazebo Roadmap"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../roadmap.md:3
msgid ""
"This page describes planned work for Gazebo. The set of planned features and "
"development efforts should provide insight into the overall direction of "
"Gazebo. If you would like to see other features on the roadmap, then please "
"get in touch with us at info@openrobotics.org."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../roadmap.md:9
msgid "Gazebo M Roadmap"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../roadmap.md:11
msgid ""
"Starting in Gazebo M, we are introducing the idea of a secondary roadmap "
"which is a list of items the Gazebo PMC is looking to implement with the "
"help of the community. Committers on the Gazebo project will focus on the "
"primary roadmap, but will provide guidance and review to anyone in the "
"community willing to work on any of the items. Each item will have one or "
"more point of contacts (POCs) who are Gazebo committers and who will be "
"responsible for coordinating with a community member to get roadmap item "
"implemented. The POC(s) will provide a description of the roadmap item on a "
"Github issue as well as some suggestions on how the feature should be "
"implemented."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../roadmap.md:22
msgid ""
"Note that the roadmap may be adjusted during the development cycle and some "
"items might move from the secondary to the primary roadmap depending on the "
"progress of primary tasks and availability of committers."
msgstr ""

